From 9d488d8cf9e1fd77c9f12786aa22dfe0b7a4566d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 07:29:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: SMART_EVENT_QUEST_ABANDONED SAI event (I-285)

- New creature SAI event 111, fired on creatures within 150yd of a player
  abandoning a quest, after quest status and spell_area auras are cleaned up
- param1 = QuestID (0 = any), param2 = onlyOwnSummon: when 1 the event only
  fires if the creature is a TempSummon of the abandoning player
- New UnitAI::sQuestAbandon virtual, forwarded by SmartAI
- Used to despawn the Frightened Miner escort (quest 14021) on abandon

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DaASnkBNWigBWmKxyaYuN8
---
